  "id": "thunder_strum",
  "name": "Thunder Strum",
  "description": "A favorite instrument of the Rocking Rebels. An ascension material for Lightning characters.",
  "story": "Concerts in Planarcadia offer a spectacle you won't see anywhere else. Under the light of the Phantasmoon, the audience's soaring emotions actually manifest and react with the performers' instruments. Taming this physical emotion is a key skill for any musician here. Sometimes, after being soaked in that fervor for too long, an instrument might even evolve into a deadly weapon.\n\n\"Burn this place to the ground! Salt the earth! Burn this place to the ground! Leave nothing but ruins!\" — A rock singer, during a solo concert\n\"Arcadia's a dream! The best place I've seen! The moon's out in bloom, and the air is serene!\" — The same singer, at a gala hosted by Pearl",
